// One per-task directory AGENT_STATE_DIR/tasks/<task-id>/ holds state.json (the
// resumable snapshot + token/timing totals), events.jsonl (the append-only
// audit trail feeding `timeline`), and run.log. State lives OUTSIDE the workdir
