  // starts a new evidence epoch so a fail-closed shopping recovery cannot
  // resurrect listings gathered for the superseded request (observed live:
  // "Not just Amazon" was read, then the fallback printed the pre-steer Amazon
  // results and even their advertising redirect).
  let researchEpoch = 0;
  let listingEvidence = 0; // priced options grounded this turn (find_listings + live fetches)
  // DB investigation: successful query/describe hits. Soft nudge asks the model
  // to self-wrap when its checklist is filled; we do NOT force early (shallow
  // answers) — AGENT_RESEARCH_HARD_CAP is the wander backstop.
  let dbEvidence = 0;
  let dbEnoughNudged = false;
