    //
    // Everything above this line is transport: the message is queued, injected,
    // drained, and every surface draws its own "⇢ steered" row from its own
    // bookkeeping. All of that proves the harness moved the text. NONE of it
    // proves the MODEL read it — the row appears whether or not the reply that
    // follows has anything to do with what the operator asked for.
    //
    // So from the operator's chair the loop looked identical either way: type a
    // steer, watch the agent keep working, wait minutes, and read a final answer
    // that may or may not reflect it (reported 2026-08-11: "I never see my
    // steers acknowledged"). The one signal a human actually trusts is the agent
    // saying, in its own words, what it is now doing differently — and nothing
