//
// A MISSION DECIDES ITS SHAPE ONCE, AND ITS STAGES INHERIT THE DECISION.
//
// Every stage is a separate harness process (runStageChild spawns `chat`), so
// each one re-ran this heuristic over its own STAGE PROMPT — a paragraph the
// PLANNER wrote, not the goal the operator typed. That is a second, quieter
